- Never execute uploaded files.
- Use generated temporary filenames.
- Avoid keeping unnecessary copies of user-uploaded files.
- Clearly report when Telegram or WhatsApp file limits prevent an operation.

Never trust a file path supplied directly by a Telegram user.

